# The test bundle: `.test-build` is a symlink to a build stamp under `.test-build.stamps/`, and the
# stamps are what churn. A trailing slash would match only a directory, so neither name gets one.
.test-build
.test-build.stamps/
var/

# The screen capture is generated by `npm run demo:record` (vhs) and deliberately not shipped.
demo/out/

# dist/index.js is committed on purpose: it is the bundled single-file install form, and CI proves it
# equals a fresh build of src/.
